---
title: "enter_market (Current Finance - Pebble Protocol Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: app.ensure_version_matches()
    q_validate --> q_check_market: app.validate_market(market)
    q_check_market --> q_check_emode: assert_emode_group_exists(emode_group)
    q_check_emode --> q_check_circuit: assert(!market.has_circuit_break_triggered())
    q_check_circuit --> q_error: circuit break triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_create: create obligation and cap
    q_create --> q_register: market.handle_new_obligation(obligation)
    q_register --> q_emit: emit ObligationCreatedEvent
    q_emit --> [*]: return obligation_cap

    note right of q_check_circuit
        INV-001: Circuit breaker prevents new obligations when market is halted
        INV-002: emode_group must exist in registry before obligation creation
        INV-003: Each obligation gets a unique ObligationOwnerCap as proof of ownership
    end note

    note right of q_create
        INV-004: Obligation is a shared object; cap is the access proof
        INV-005: emode_group is immutable once obligation is created
    end note
